<template name="config-menu__jfg_controls">
    <head>
    </head>
    <body>
        <form class="config__form">
            <div class="config__hz-wrapper">
                <!-- Options (generated by tools/gen_jfg_config_rml.py) -->
                <div class="config__wrapper" data-event-mouseout="set_cur_config_index(-1)" style="overflow-y: auto; height: 100%;">
                    <div class="config-option" style="margin: 24dp 0dp 0dp;"><label class="config-option__title config-group__title">Players</label></div>
                    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: row; margin: 8dp 12dp 0dp;">
                        <div style="display: block; flex: 2 1 0dp; margin: 0dp 12dp 0dp 0dp; padding: 12dp 14dp; border-width: 2dp; border-color: #ffb21a; border-radius: 8dp; background-color: rgba(255,178,26,0.08);"><div style="display: block; font-size: 22dp; line-height: 28dp; font-weight: bold;">P1</div><div style="display: block; margin-top: 6dp; font-size: 20dp; line-height: 26dp;">{{p1_device}}</div><div data-if="p1_name != ''"><div class="jfg-note" style="display: block; margin-top: 4dp; font-size: 15dp; line-height: 20dp;">{{p1_name}}</div></div></div>
                        <div style="display: block; flex: 1 1 0dp; margin: 0dp 12dp 0dp 0dp; padding: 12dp 14dp; border-width: 2dp; border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); border-radius: 8dp; opacity: 0.45;"><div style="display: block; font-size: 22dp; line-height: 28dp; font-weight: bold;">P2</div><div class="jfg-note" style="display: block; margin-top: 6dp; font-size: 16dp; line-height: 22dp;">Coming later</div></div>
                        <div style="display: block; flex: 1 1 0dp; margin: 0dp 12dp 0dp 0dp; padding: 12dp 14dp; border-width: 2dp; border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); border-radius: 8dp; opacity: 0.45;"><div style="display: block; font-size: 22dp; line-height: 28dp; font-weight: bold;">P3</div><div class="jfg-note" style="display: block; margin-top: 6dp; font-size: 16dp; line-height: 22dp;">Coming later</div></div>
                        <div style="display: block; flex: 1 1 0dp; margin: 0dp 12dp 0dp 0dp; padding: 12dp 14dp; border-width: 2dp; border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); border-radius: 8dp; opacity: 0.45;"><div style="display: block; font-size: 22dp; line-height: 28dp; font-weight: bold;">P4</div><div class="jfg-note" style="display: block; margin-top: 6dp; font-size: 16dp; line-height: 22dp;">Coming later</div></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="jfg-note" style="display: block; margin: 10dp 12dp 0dp; font-size: 18dp; line-height: 26dp;"><span data-if="controller_count &gt; 1">{{controller_count}} <span>controllers connected: all control P1.</span> </span><span>Multiplayer: coming later.</span></div>
                    <div class="config-option" style="margin: 24dp 0dp 0dp;"><label class="config-option__title config-group__title">Quick Setup</label></div>
                    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: row; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 10dp 12dp 0dp;">
                            <button class="button" id="jfg_qs_modern" data-class-jfg-selected="qs_mode == 'modern'" data-event-click="quick_setup('modern')" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(1001)" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(1001)" style="display: block; flex: 0 0 auto; white-space: nowrap; margin: 0dp 10dp 12dp 0dp; padding-left: 12dp; padding-right: 12dp; nav-up: #tab_jfg_controls; nav-down: #jfg_customize_buttons; nav-left: #tab_jfg_controls; nav-right: #jfg_qs_n64;">Modern<span data-if="qs_recommend == 'modern'"><span style="margin-left: 8dp; padding: 2dp 6dp; font-size: 13dp; line-height: 18dp; letter-spacing: 1dp; background-color: #ffb21a; color: #050b1c;">Recommended</span></span></button>
                            <button class="button" id="jfg_qs_n64" data-class-jfg-selected="qs_mode == 'n64'" data-event-click="quick_setup('n64')" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(1002)" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(1002)" style="display: block; flex: 0 0 auto; white-space: nowrap; margin: 0dp 10dp 12dp 0dp; padding-left: 12dp; padding-right: 12dp; nav-up: #tab_jfg_controls; nav-down: #jfg_customize_buttons; nav-left: #jfg_qs_modern; nav-right: #jfg_qs_custom;">Original N64<span data-if="qs_recommend == 'n64'"><span style="margin-left: 8dp; padding: 2dp 6dp; font-size: 13dp; line-height: 18dp; letter-spacing: 1dp; background-color: #ffb21a; color: #050b1c;">Recommended</span></span></button>
                            <button class="button" id="jfg_qs_custom" data-class-jfg-selected="qs_mode == 'custom'" data-event-click="quick_setup('custom')" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(1003)" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(1003)" style="display: block; flex: 0 0 auto; white-space: nowrap; margin: 0dp 10dp 12dp 0dp; padding-left: 12dp; padding-right: 12dp; nav-up: #tab_jfg_controls; nav-down: #jfg_customize_buttons; nav-left: #jfg_qs_n64; nav-right: none;">Custom<span data-if="qs_recommend == 'custom'"><span style="margin-left: 8dp; padding: 2dp 6dp; font-size: 13dp; line-height: 18dp; letter-spacing: 1dp; background-color: #ffb21a; color: #050b1c;">Recommended</span></span></button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="jfg-note" style="display: block; margin: 0dp 12dp 0dp; font-size: 18dp; line-height: 26dp;">Sets the Layout switches below in one go. Nothing changes until you pick one.</div>
                    <div style="display: block; margin: 20dp 12dp 0dp;">
                        <button class="button" id="jfg_customize_buttons" data-event-click="open_bindings()" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(1004)" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(1004)" style="display: inline-block; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_qs_modern; nav-down: #jfg_dual_stick_on; nav-left: #tab_jfg_controls; nav-right: none;">Customize Buttons</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" style="margin: 24dp 0dp 0dp;"><label class="config-option__title config-group__title">Layout</label></div>
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(0)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Dual-Stick Controls</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(0)" name="jfg_dual_stick" data-checked="dual_stick" value="1" id="jfg_dual_stick_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_customize_buttons; nav-down: #jfg_dual_layout_on;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_dual_stick_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(0)" name="jfg_dual_stick" data-checked="dual_stick" value="0" id="jfg_dual_stick_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_customize_buttons; nav-down: #jfg_dual_layout_off;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_dual_stick_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(1)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Built-in Button Layout</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(1)" name="jfg_dual_layout" data-checked="dual_layout" value="1" id="jfg_dual_layout_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_dual_stick_on; nav-down: #jfg_swap_triggers_on;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_dual_layout_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(1)" name="jfg_dual_layout" data-checked="dual_layout" value="0" id="jfg_dual_layout_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_dual_stick_off; nav-down: #jfg_swap_triggers_off;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_dual_layout_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(2)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Swap Triggers</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(2)" name="jfg_swap_triggers" data-checked="swap_triggers" value="1" id="jfg_swap_triggers_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_dual_layout_on; nav-down: #jfg_invert_aim_y_on;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_swap_triggers_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(2)" name="jfg_swap_triggers" data-checked="swap_triggers" value="0" id="jfg_swap_triggers_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_dual_layout_off; nav-down: #jfg_invert_aim_y_off;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_swap_triggers_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" style="margin: 24dp 0dp 0dp;"><label class="config-option__title config-group__title">Camera &amp; Aim</label></div>
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(3)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Invert Aim Up/Down</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(3)" name="jfg_invert_aim_y" data-checked="invert_aim_y" value="1" id="jfg_invert_aim_y_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_swap_triggers_on; nav-down: #jfg_invert_camera_y_on;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_invert_aim_y_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(3)" name="jfg_invert_aim_y" data-checked="invert_aim_y" value="0" id="jfg_invert_aim_y_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_swap_triggers_off; nav-down: #jfg_invert_camera_y_off;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_invert_aim_y_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(4)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Invert Camera Up/Down</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(4)" name="jfg_invert_camera_y" data-checked="invert_camera_y" value="1" id="jfg_invert_camera_y_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_invert_aim_y_on; nav-down: #jfg_aim_from_character_on;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_invert_camera_y_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(4)" name="jfg_invert_camera_y" data-checked="invert_camera_y" value="0" id="jfg_invert_camera_y_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_invert_aim_y_off; nav-down: #jfg_aim_from_character_off;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_invert_camera_y_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(5)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Aim Where the Character Faces</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(5)" name="jfg_aim_from_character" data-checked="aim_from_character" value="1" id="jfg_aim_from_character_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_invert_camera_y_on; nav-down: #jfg_camera_speed_h_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_aim_from_character_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(5)" name="jfg_aim_from_character" data-checked="aim_from_character" value="0" id="jfg_aim_from_character_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_invert_camera_y_off; nav-down: #jfg_camera_speed_h_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_aim_from_character_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(6)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Camera Left/Right</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{camera_speed_h}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(6)" id="jfg_camera_speed_h_input" type="range" min="10" max="400" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_aim_from_character_on; nav-down: #jfg_camera_speed_v_input;" data-value="camera_speed_h"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(7)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Camera Up/Down</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{camera_speed_v}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(7)" id="jfg_camera_speed_v_input" type="range" min="10" max="400" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_camera_speed_h_input; nav-down: #jfg_camera_distance_input;" data-value="camera_speed_v"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(8)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Camera Distance</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{camera_distance}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(8)" id="jfg_camera_distance_input" type="range" min="50" max="250" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_camera_speed_v_input; nav-down: #jfg_camera_collision_on;" data-value="camera_distance"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(9)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Camera Collision</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(9)" name="jfg_camera_collision" data-checked="camera_collision" value="1" id="jfg_camera_collision_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_camera_distance_input; nav-down: #jfg_aim_centered_on;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_camera_collision_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(9)" name="jfg_camera_collision" data-checked="camera_collision" value="0" id="jfg_camera_collision_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_camera_distance_input; nav-down: #jfg_aim_centered_off;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_camera_collision_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(10)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Keep the Reticle Centered</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(10)" name="jfg_aim_centered" data-checked="aim_centered" value="1" id="jfg_aim_centered_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_camera_collision_on; nav-down: #jfg_aim_jump_on;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_aim_centered_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(10)" name="jfg_aim_centered" data-checked="aim_centered" value="0" id="jfg_aim_centered_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_camera_collision_off; nav-down: #jfg_aim_jump_off;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_aim_centered_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(11)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Jump While Aiming</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(11)" name="jfg_aim_jump" data-checked="aim_jump" value="1" id="jfg_aim_jump_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_aim_centered_on; nav-down: #jfg_aim_speed_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_aim_jump_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(11)" name="jfg_aim_jump" data-checked="aim_jump" value="0" id="jfg_aim_jump_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_aim_centered_off; nav-down: #jfg_aim_speed_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_aim_jump_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(12)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Aim Speed</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{aim_speed}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(12)" id="jfg_aim_speed_input" type="range" min="10" max="300" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_aim_jump_on; nav-down: #jfg_sniper_fixed_zoom_on;" data-value="aim_speed"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(13)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Sniper Fixed Zoom</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(13)" name="jfg_sniper_fixed_zoom" data-checked="sniper_fixed_zoom" value="1" id="jfg_sniper_fixed_zoom_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_aim_speed_input; nav-down: #jfg_sniper_zoom_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_sniper_fixed_zoom_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(13)" name="jfg_sniper_fixed_zoom" data-checked="sniper_fixed_zoom" value="0" id="jfg_sniper_fixed_zoom_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_aim_speed_input; nav-down: #jfg_sniper_zoom_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_sniper_fixed_zoom_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(14)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Sniper Zoom</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{sniper_zoom}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(14)" id="jfg_sniper_zoom_input" type="range" min="100" max="500" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_sniper_fixed_zoom_on; nav-down: #jfg_invert_aim_normal_on;" data-value="sniper_zoom"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(15)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Invert Aim (Original Controls)</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(15)" name="jfg_invert_aim_normal" data-checked="invert_aim_normal" value="1" id="jfg_invert_aim_normal_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_sniper_zoom_input; nav-down: #jfg_joystick_deadzone_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_invert_aim_normal_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(15)" name="jfg_invert_aim_normal" data-checked="invert_aim_normal" value="0" id="jfg_invert_aim_normal_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_sniper_zoom_input; nav-down: #jfg_joystick_deadzone_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_invert_aim_normal_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" style="margin: 24dp 0dp 0dp;"><label class="config-option__title config-group__title">Sticks &amp; Rumble</label></div>
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(16)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Joystick Deadzone</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{joystick_deadzone}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(16)" id="jfg_joystick_deadzone_input" type="range" min="0" max="100" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_invert_aim_normal_on; nav-down: #jfg_joystick_range_input;" data-value="joystick_deadzone"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(17)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Joystick Range</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{joystick_range}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(17)" id="jfg_joystick_range_input" type="range" min="0" max="100" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_joystick_deadzone_input; nav-down: #jfg_rumble_strength_input;" data-value="joystick_range"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(18)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Rumble Strength</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{rumble_strength}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(18)" id="jfg_rumble_strength_input" type="range" min="0" max="100" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_joystick_range_input; nav-down: #jfg_background_input_on;" data-value="rumble_strength"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(19)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Background Input</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(19)" name="jfg_background_input" data-checked="background_input" value="1" id="jfg_background_input_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_rumble_strength_input; " data-style-nav-down="mk_hidden ? 'none' : '#jfg_mouse_keyboard_on'"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_background_input_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(19)" name="jfg_background_input" data-checked="background_input" value="0" id="jfg_background_input_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_rumble_strength_input; " data-style-nav-down="mk_hidden ? 'none' : '#jfg_mouse_keyboard_off'"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_background_input_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div data-if="!mk_hidden"><div class="config-option" style="margin: 24dp 0dp 0dp;"><label class="config-option__title config-group__title">Mouse &amp; Keyboard</label></div></div>
                    <div data-if="!mk_hidden">
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(20)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Mouse and Keyboard Controls</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(20)" name="jfg_mouse_keyboard" data-checked="mouse_keyboard" value="1" id="jfg_mouse_keyboard_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_background_input_on; nav-down: #jfg_mouse_camera_speed_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_mouse_keyboard_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(20)" name="jfg_mouse_keyboard" data-checked="mouse_keyboard" value="0" id="jfg_mouse_keyboard_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_background_input_off; nav-down: #jfg_mouse_camera_speed_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_mouse_keyboard_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    </div>
                    <div data-if="!mk_hidden">
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(21)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Mouse Camera Speed</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{mouse_camera_speed}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(21)" id="jfg_mouse_camera_speed_input" type="range" min="10" max="400" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_mouse_keyboard_on; nav-down: #jfg_mouse_aim_speed_input;" data-value="mouse_camera_speed"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    </div>
                    <div data-if="!mk_hidden">
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(22)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Mouse Aim Speed</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{mouse_aim_speed}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(22)" id="jfg_mouse_aim_speed_input" type="range" min="10" max="400" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_mouse_camera_speed_input; nav-down: #jfg_invert_mouse_y_on;" data-value="mouse_aim_speed"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    </div>
                    <div data-if="!mk_hidden">
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(23)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Invert Mouse Up/Down</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(23)" name="jfg_invert_mouse_y" data-checked="invert_mouse_y" value="1" id="jfg_invert_mouse_y_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_mouse_aim_speed_input; nav-down: none;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_invert_mouse_y_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(23)" name="jfg_invert_mouse_y" data-checked="invert_mouse_y" value="0" id="jfg_invert_mouse_y_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_mouse_aim_speed_input; nav-down: none;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_invert_mouse_y_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
                <!-- Descriptions -->
                <div class="config__wrapper jfg-desc">
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 0"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Dual-Stick Controls</div><p>Right stick: moves the camera around the character. Left stick: runs in the pushed direction as seen from the camera. While the aim button is held the right stick aims and the left stick moves, as in a first-person game. Menus, cutscenes, Floyd missions and the races keep the normal layout.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 1"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Built-in Button Layout</div><p>LT aim, RT fire. A jump, B or left-stick click crouch. RB / Y next weapon, LB / X previous weapon. D-pad: weapon select; up/down zoom while aiming. View / right-stick click: N64 L. Off: your own controller bindings.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 2"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Swap Triggers</div><p>RT aims and LT fires.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 3"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Invert Aim Up/Down</div><p>Dual stick: right stick up aims down (the game's original flight-stick style).</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 4"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Invert Camera Up/Down</div><p>Dual stick: right stick up lowers the camera instead of raising the view.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 5"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Aim Where the Character Faces</div><p>On aiming, the view turns to the character instead of the character to the view.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 6"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Camera Left/Right</div><p>Dual stick: how fast the right stick turns the camera sideways.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 7"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Camera Up/Down</div><p>Dual stick: how fast the right stick moves the camera up and down.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 8"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Camera Distance</div><p>Dual stick: how far back the camera is from the character, as a share of the game's own distance. Lower is closer.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 9"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Camera Collision</div><p>Dual stick: the camera stays inside the level (the game's own wall check) instead of going through walls.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 10"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Keep the Reticle Centered</div><p>While aiming, the view turns as soon as the stick moves and the reticle stays in the middle (instead of the reticle first travelling to the edge of a box and drifting back).</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 11"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Jump While Aiming</div><p>The jump button jumps while aiming, also while walking or strafing: the character leaves the aim for the jump and aims again on landing if the aim button is still held. The sniper scope then zooms with the D-pad (dual stick) or 1 / 3 (mouse and keyboard).</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 12"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Aim Speed</div><p>How fast the stick turns the view / moves the reticle while aiming.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 13"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Sniper Fixed Zoom</div><p>The Sniper Rifle's scope stays at the zoom set below; the zoom buttons do nothing.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 14"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Sniper Zoom</div><p>The fixed zoom of the Sniper Rifle: 100% is no zoom, 500% the game's closest.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 15"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Invert Aim (Original Controls)</div><p>Original controls only: flip the stick's up/down while aiming (R held).</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 16"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Joystick Deadzone</div><p>Applies a deadzone to joystick inputs.<br/><br/><b>Note: the game may apply a small additional deadzone of its own.</b></p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 17"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Joystick Range</div><p>Sets the input range the joystick is mapped to. A real N64 controller usually does not reach the full technical range.<br/><br/>Values above 62% increase joystick sensitivity. <i>Warning:</i> below 62% the stick can no longer reach its maximum values, which may hinder gameplay. If your joystick cannot reach 100% in the cardinal directions, set this above 62% to compensate.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 18"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Rumble Strength</div><p>The strength of rumble on a controller that supports it. <b>Zero turns rumble off.</b> Jet Force Gemini supports the Rumble Pak.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 19"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Background Input</div><p>The game reads the controller while its window is not in focus. <b>Keyboard input is not affected.</b></p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 20"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Mouse and Keyboard Controls</div><p>Plays like the dual-stick controls: WASD run, the mouse turns the camera, hold the right button to aim and click the left to fire, the wheel changes weapon. Space jumps, Left Ctrl or C crouches, Enter is START, Tab is N64 L, 1-4 are the D-pad. The cursor is captured during gameplay only.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 21"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Mouse Camera Speed</div><p>How fast the mouse turns the camera.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 22"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Mouse Aim Speed</div><p>How fast the mouse aims.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 23"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Invert Mouse Up/Down</div><p>Mouse forward looks down.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 1001"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Modern</div><p>Dual-stick controls with the built-in button layout, and mouse and keyboard controls: the right stick or the mouse turns the camera, LT or the right mouse button aims, RT or the left button fires.<br/><br/>Sets <b>Dual-Stick Controls</b>, <b>Built-in Button Layout</b> and <b>Mouse and Keyboard Controls</b> on.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 1002"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Original N64</div><p>The original game's controls: the stick runs and turns the character as on the N64, with your button bindings.<br/><br/>Sets <b>Dual-Stick Controls</b> and <b>Mouse and Keyboard Controls</b> off.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 1003"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Custom</div><p>Dual-stick controls with your own button bindings (Customize Buttons).<br/><br/>Sets <b>Dual-Stick Controls</b> on and <b>Built-in Button Layout</b> off.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 1004"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Customize Buttons</div><p>Choose which button or key does what, for the controller and for the keyboard. While the Built-in Button Layout or mouse and keyboard controls are on, they use their own layout during play.</p></div></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </form>
    </body>
</template>
